      "OLIVIA uses ELECTRIC POKéMON.\\p",
      "Switches reroute the barriers.\\p",
      "Think like a circuit. Find the\\n",
      "path before forcing the load.$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory": [
      "You read the whole circuit!\\p",
      "The path is yours now.$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkIntro": [
      "Current needs a path.\\p",
      "I'll make sure yours ends here!$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkDefeat": [
      "You grounded my whole plan!$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkPostBattle": [
      "Fast isn't the same as reckless.\\p",
      "OLIVIA drills that into us.$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnIntro": [
      "OLIVIA taught me to watch load.\\p",
      "Let's see what your team can do!$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnDefeat": [
      "My circuit overloaded.$"
    ],
    "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnPostBattle": [
